    "広告を見て%lld枚で復活するか、最初からやり直せます" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Watch an ad to revive with %lld chips, or start over"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "広告を見て%lld枚で復活（1セッションに1回）" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Watch an ad: revive with %lld chips (once per session)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "広告を見ているあいだにセッションが変わったため、復活は適用していません。復活の回数は減っていません。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The session changed while the ad was playing, so the revive wasn't applied. It didn't use up your revive."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "広告を見ると 1 セッションに 1 回だけ %1$lld 枚で復活できます。最初からやり直すと %2$lld 枚に戻ります。チップはゲーム内だけのもので、現金とは交換できません。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Once per session, you can watch an ad to revive with %1$lld chips. Starting over resets you to %2$lld chips. Chips are for in-game use only and can't be exchanged for money."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "復活はこのセッションで使いました。最初からやり直せます" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You've used your revive this session. You can start over."
