    "赤黒・奇数偶数・1〜18・19〜36・12 個の区分はすべて外れ。数字 1 点の 0 だけが当たりです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Red/black, odd/even, 1-18/19-36 and the dozens all lose. Only a straight-up bet on 0 wins."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "配当 1 倍。当たると元金と同額が戻ります（10 枚なら 20 枚）。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pays 1 to 1. A win returns your bet plus the same amount (a 10-chip bet returns 20)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "配当 2 倍。12 個の数字のどれかが出れば当たり（10 枚なら 30 枚）。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pays 2 to 1. Wins if any of its 12 numbers comes up (a 10-chip bet returns 30)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "配当 35 倍。当たると元金に加えて 35 倍が戻ります（10 枚なら 360 枚）。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pays 35 to 1. A win returns your bet plus 35 times it (a 10-chip bet returns 360)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
